# llm_api_domains.txt
# API hosts of LLM providers (litellm/models/*.yaml). Reachable through Squid from
# LiteLLM only (its own network to Squid, as-net-litellm-egress), never from the agents: an
# agent with someone else's API key could otherwise send data to that account.
# LAN endpoints do not go here: squid/conf/lan.hosts (*.lan.internal).

openrouter.ai
